OL,3,GNEWSACar wash next to derelict pub
OL,4,Aordered to close
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car wash has been ordered to close
OL,7,Fafter it was found to be operating on a
OL,8,Fcar park of a former pub without
OL,9,Fauthorisation.
OL,11,FThe Butts Hand Car Wash was operating
OL,12,Fon a car park of the former Butts
OL,13,FRetreat pub, later known as The
OL,14,FHamptons, in Spon End, Coventry.
OL,16,FThe city council's planning department
OL,17,Fsaid the unauthorised car wash caused
OL,18,F"undesirable levels of noise" and jet
OL,19,Fsprays could lead to "the uncontrolled
OL,20,Frelease of contaminated water" into the
OL,21,Fnearby River Sherbourne.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
